name: Connect with Claude
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/Oryn/sca/connect-with-claude/icon.svg
version: 1.2.0
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Connects Sugarcane to Claude through the Anthropic Messages API (your own API key, model name configurable). Claude uses native tool use to run the editor's 90+ slash commands (find/replace, formatting, lists, headings, tables, pages, margins, watermark, headers/footers, export, stats…) and can also operate the UI like a person — snapshot the screen, click, right-click, double/triple-click, hold, hover, drag, type, press keys, scroll, set form values, and take screenshots. Optional Bridge mode lets the Claude connector on claude.ai drive the editor through a free self-hosted relay Worker (open the built-in guide with /guide), with no API key. A bar at the top of the screen shows when Claude is working, what it is doing, and lets you stop it. Every command and action is also available by hand as a manual slash command with a "/" palette. Scoped page/element permissions, auto-execute or approve-each-time, gated UI control (30 actions per confirmation) and an optional Screen Share mode. The chat panel and the Claude Configuration section are hidden from Claude, so it can never flip its own permissions or read your key.
p/html:
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/Oryn/sca/connect-with-claude/connect-with-claude.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/Oryn/sca/connect-with-claude/connect-with-claude.js
